  _id: 14201240
  _key: DIALOGUE_NODE_SIR_ALDRIC_GORVAKH_DEFEATED
  _displayName: Gor'Vakh Defeated
  _description: Aldric reflects on the defeat of Gor'Vakh and the fulfillment of
    his unfinished oath.
  _speakerName: Sir Aldric
  _dialogueSegments:
  - It is over... Gor'Vakh has fallen. After all these years, the shadow that haunted
    this Sanctum is finally gone.
  - I thought I would feel nothing but triumph when this day came. Instead, I find
    myself remembering those who could not stand here with us.
  - You have done more than save my life, friend. You have helped me fulfill an oath
    I feared would remain broken forever.
  _dialogueText: 
  _choices:
  - _choiceText: We fulfilled it together.
